    fields:  # 9109
      statement: "Consumers of test-status honor a single-source chokepoint appropriate to their pipeline stage — canonical Symbol.is_test_file where symbols are classified (framework-pattern matcher), or the shared paths.is_test_file chokepoint where they are not yet classified (filesystem-scan linkers, e.g. message-queue) or where a deliberately broader 'test-or-support' predicate is the correct concept (entrypoint ranking, WI-popok KEEP). No consumer re-derives test status via a private divergent heuristic or ignores it."  # 9109
