  message: "SATISFIED 2026-07-17 (owner-approved statement amendment). Statement AMENDED letter->spirit to reconcile with the owner-approved WI-popok KEEP verdict + filesystem-scan-linker timing: consumers honor test-status via the single-source chokepoint appropriate to their pipeline STAGE. All 3 named consumers verified: (1) framework-pattern matcher (WI-bosab done) gates on canonical Symbol.is_test_file via post-classification strip_test_file_only_concepts (framework_patterns.py:1377); (2) message-queue linker (WI-nitob done) gates via find_non_test_files -> shared paths.is_test_file (message_queue.py:244), correct because linkers self-scan files BEFORE classification; (3) entrypoint detector (WI-popok wont_do-KEEP) uses paths.is_test_file, a deliberately BROADER test-or-support predicate (concept-audit KEEP, owner-approved). None re-derives via a private divergent heuristic (the 4 old _is_test_path copies folded onto the shared chokepoint, supply-verdict:F1) or ignores it; taint.py:match_sink verified NOT to gate on test-ness. Behavioral evidence: WI-bosab test_excludes_canonical_test_vocabulary_handlers, WI-nitob 103->0 test-sourced event_publishes, WI-popok guard test."  # c201
